          "jcr:created": "Mon Sep 10 2018 18:49:18 GMT-0400",
          "text": "<p><span class=\"futura-bold\"><span class=\"fontsize-1-5em\">The Ergonomics and Utility <br>\n of SPY-PHI</span></span></p>\n<p>Dr. David Weintritt discusses the utility and ergonomics of Stryker's SPY Portable Handheld Imager<br>\n</p>\n",
