        "text_copy": {
          "jcr:primaryType": "nt:unstructured",
          "jcr:createdBy": "lee.fuller1@stryker.com",
          "jcr:lastModifiedBy": "lee.fuller1@stryker.com",
          "jcr:created": "Mon Sep 10 2018 18:49:18 GMT-0400",
          "text": "<p><span class=\"futura-bold\"><span class=\"fontsize-1-5em\">SPY Fluorescence Imaging Technology</span></span><br>\n</p>\n<p>Adequate blood flow is crucial to surgical success and the body’s ability to heal. Even a few hours of impaired blood flow can lead to post-operative complications. SPY Fluorescence Imaging technology allows surgeons to visualize blood flow intraoperatively, which may help them make certain decisions to improve surgical outcomes.<br>\n</p>\n",
          "jcr:lastModified": "Thu Sep 19 2019 23:11:56 GMT+0000",
          "sling:resourceType": "stryker/components/content/text",
          "textIsRich": "true"
        }
      },
